@format 1
@id export.edit-preset
@title Edit export preset
@area Export
@entry input
@summary Open the encoder editor for current export state and refresh modification status after a confirmed edit.
@flow TB
@related export.apply-preset, export.commit-modifications

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Encoder settings requested <input>
- Open the encoder settings dialog for tab-specific state @ export.PExportDialogShow(...)
> edit

[edit] Edit output settings <decision>
- Let the dialog modify video, audio, container, and encoder options @ export.PExportDialogShow(...)
? "Dialog is cancelled" > unchanged
? "Dialog is accepted" > refresh

[refresh] Refresh export surface <process>
- Recompute summary and selected-preset modification state @ export.PExportSummaryUpdate(...)
> result

[result] Export settings edited <output>
= The tab-specific output state reflects the accepted encoder settings.

[unchanged] Settings unchanged <output>
= Closing the editor without acceptance retains the previous state.
